cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use SpatioS2E, please cite this software and specify the version used.
title: "SpatioS2E: component-resolved evaluation of gene-conditioned virtual spatial transcriptomics"
type: software
abstract: >-
  SpatioS2E provides evaluation tools and gene-conditioned predictors for
  virtual spatial transcriptomics. It separates gene-mean prediction from
  within-gene spatial variation and includes matched gene-vector controls,
  held-out-gene training and the analysis workflows used in the accompanying study.
authors:
